-barcode-isnt-scanning","My barcode isn't scanning","the-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do",{"titleTag":334,"metaDescription":335,"canonical":336,"subpath2":337,"category":346,"linkText":315,"additionalHelp":6,"slices":354},"My locker is too small, what can I do? | Evri","We have a range of Evri Locker sizes to suit different parcel sizes. If the Locker you get isn't big enough for your item, here's what you can do.","the-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fthe-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do",{"id":338,"type":339,"tags":340,"lang":341,"slug":305,"first_publication_date":342,"last_publication_date":342,"uid":305,"link_type":343,"key":344,"isBroken":345},"Yhj0nxIAACkA3Cgw","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:24:19+0000","Document","e0857326-86f0-46fc-8b99-7eef55b76466",false,{"id":347,"type":348,"tags":349,"lang":341,"slug":305,"first_publication_date":351,"last_publication_date":352,"uid":305,"link_type":343,"key":353,"isBroken":345},"YituGBEAACsAQzK1","faq-category",[350],"FAQs","2022-03-11T15:43:53+0000","2022-05-12T12:57:42+0000","3d8b5122-958f-4a6b-a195-b8d4bd99d4e2",[355],{"variation":356,"version":357,"items":358,"primary":360,"id":401,"slice_type":402,"slice_label":8},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[359],{},{"content":361},[362,370,374,377,383,399],{"type":363,"text":315,"spans":364,"direction":369},"heading1",[365],{"start":366,"end":367,"type":368},0,53,"strong","ltr",{"type":371,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":369},"paragraph","",[],{"type":371,"text":375,"spans":376,"direction":369},"The first locker door that opens will always be the smallest available. If your parcel is too big for this Locker box, select “change box size” on the terminal and choose the Locker box that’s most suitable for your parcel.",[],{"type":371,"text":378,"spans":379,"direction":369},"The maximum dimensions on an Evri Locker is as follows: width 39cm, length 62cm, depth 57cm",[380],{"start":381,"end":382,"type":368},56,91,{"type":371,"text":384,"spans":385,"direction":369},"If your parcel is too big for a Locker, there are other easy ways to send with us. You can take it to a ParcelShop, where you can also print out your labels in store if you don’t have access to a printer, or arrange a courier collection from your home or workplace. ",[386,398],{"start":387,"end":388,"type":389,"data":390},104,114,"hyperlink",{"id":391,"type":392,"tags":393,"lang":341,"slug":394,"first_publication_date":395,"last_publication_date":396,"uid":149,"url":397,"link_type":343,"isBroken":345},"YhTflBEAACYA1FEy","content-page",[150],"parcelshops--parcel-pick-up--drop-off-points--evri","2022-02-22T13:38:47+0000","2026-03-09T20:42:49+0000","\u002Fparcelshops",{"start":387,"end":388,"type":368},{"type":371,"text":372,"spans":400,"direction":369},[],"rich_text$4887e58e-cbbe-4d79-88ea-c1da1e8f96b1","rich_text","Feb 28, 2022",["Reactive",405],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":406,"$sclients":473,"$sglobal-basket-count":8},{"abtasty":407,"accessibe":411,"appPromoBanner":414,"autoDivertUpdates":417,"awin":420,"bulkInternational":423,"bulkSendEnabled":426,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":429,"enableBasketCount":432,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":435,"euCustomsDuty":438,"groovyAdvert":441,"newInternationalSendFlow":444,"newinternationalpages":451,"oohPreferenceFlag":455,"opentel":458,"premium":461,"savedCards":464,"smallParcelSize":467,"yourPricesDrawer":470},{"_createdAt":408,"_updatedAt":409,"enabled":410},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":412,"_updatedAt":413,"enabled":410},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":415,"_updatedAt":416,"enabled":345},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":418,"_updatedAt":419,"enabled":345},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":421,"_updatedAt":422,"enabled":345},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_created